From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sgd3dinterop, d3d11: CreateDirect3D11DeviceFromDXGIDevice and CreateDirect3D11SurfaceFromDXGISurface.

A DXGI device or surface wrapped as the WinRT IDirect3DDevice / IDirect3DSurface that
Windows.Graphics.Capture, MediaCapture and the composition APIs take, with
IDirect3DDxgiInterfaceAccess (the DXGI/D3D11 object back) and IClosable (let go; RO_E_CLOSED after).
IDirect3DDevice::Trim trims through IDXGIDevice3; IDirect3DSurface::Description is the surface's.
In a DLL of its own, sgd3dinterop, so that Wine's d3d11.dll and DXVK's (sg-d3d, dxvk/patches/0011)
both forward to the same implementation. OBS's Windows Graphics Capture plugin, PotPlayer's and
Zoom's capture DLLs import them; they ended at 'unimplemented function'. Adds the SDK's
windows.graphics.directx.direct3d11.interop header (as IDL).
---
